 Percentage of Team Points Scored by Marcus\n\nTo find the percentage, use the formula:\n\n$$\n\\text{Percentage} = \\left( \\frac{\\text{Marcus's Points}}{\\text{Team's Total Points}} \\right) \\times 100\n$$\n\n$$\n\\text{Percentage} = \\left( \\frac{35}{70} \\right) \\times 100 = 0.5 \\times 100 = 50\\%\n$$\n\n---\n\n### Final Answer\n\n$$\n\\boxed{50}\n$$", "leakage_spans": ["matches the ground truth", "didn't look at that", "not to leak the ground truth answer"]}
